# Theme: light + dark together

When changing any visual (colors, fills, text, chips, cards, avatars, overlays, backgrounds):

- Update **both** light and dark in the same change via `theme.rs` palette tokens.
- Do not hard-code white/light plates for shell UI that must follow dark mode (unread rows, list chrome, etc.).
- Intentional exception: HTML mail reader card / webview backdrop stay light paper.
- See root `AGENTS.md` for the full note.
